# data/manifests/*.csv holds verbatim, machine-generated provenance data
# (e.g. RCSB citation titles with embedded newlines / trailing spaces as
# returned by the API). Trailing whitespace inside these fields is real
# retrieved content, not a code-style issue — it must never be silently
# stripped or "cleaned up" to satisfy `git diff --check`, since that would
# be an undocumented modification of source data. This attribute tells Git
# not to flag it as a whitespace error.
data/manifests/*.csv -whitespace
